acter_id\": \"char_rhea\",\n      \"set\": {\n        \"inventory.ITEM_ash_fungus.container\": \"blazer_pocket_left\",\n        \"inventory.ITEM_ash_fungus.status\": \"stowed\"\n      },\n      \"reason\": \"Stowed the fungus to free a hand for throwing a stone.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
